Z||000000||Elenor84||10-06-2001||10:04 PM||||Hey guys...it happended again today but this time she would not fire up again...I got it towed to my house now...what is the bloody problem...I followed all the wires from the battery to the starter and alternator and there all fine...I redid my batery connection and still nothing...the lights on my dash don't light up when I click the key one forward...why is it not lighting up my dash?<BR>Could it be my alternator or no?<P>------------------<BR>Lance<BR>Click Image to go to site.<BR><A HREF="http://members.nbci.com/_XMCM/lancegspage/Index.html" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Side1.jpg"> </A>||||reg||1
