Z||000002||SLYGUY||10-07-2001||03:08 AM||||Have you checked all of the fuses?<P>Might be the ingnition switch itself. Would explain why the guages go wacky just before the engine dies. If you have a bad connection in the switch itself, the guages think that you are switching the key off and on very quickly. Finally something snaps.<P>Good luck, I'll be watching other responses.<P>Sly||||reg||1
